{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sfjetskirentals/items/597414/", "pk": 597414, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sfjetskirentals/", "pk": 94336, "shortname": "sfjetskirentals", "name": "Jetski Rentals of South Florida", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Ferreti Destiny 85 ft", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 3, "unicode": "Ferreti Destiny 85 ft", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 41500, "description": "", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "##85 ft Ferreti Destiny\n\n###Address: \n*3399 NW South River Dr\nMiami, FL  33142\nUnited States*\n\n###Activities Coordinator: **MIKE**\n(786) 670-3013\n\n##Confirmation:\n###85 ft Ferreti Destiny\n\nHere is some info that I hope will answer any questions you may have. \n\nPlease try and arrive a half hour early as we have sign coast guard documents and get you guys comfortable on the yacht. Safety first.\n\nThe crew and yacht will be ready for you for the start of your contracted time. The yacht runs on a tight schedule and adjusting start times is not an option. Please try and arrive early. \n\nThe captain will address all of your guests about safety first. It’s real important that everyone is paying attention. We take the safety of our guests very seriously. \n\nFederal Law limits the maximum amount of guests allowed on a Recreational Bareboat Charter is 13. Kids count towards the total of 13. The captain and crew DO NOT count. Please make sure we don’t have more than 13 as there are no exceptions. \n\nEveryone must remove their shoes while onboard the yacht. \n\nSome smoking is permitted on the yacht. Cigarettes, Cigars, Wacky tabaky is ok as long as the guests are using a small cup for the ashes. Hookahs are NOT allowed on the yacht (no exceptions). Vapes are okay. \n\nUse of the bathroom is allowed but you must dispose of toilet paper and / or personal hygiene products in the waste basket provided. A crew member will assist you with flushing the toilet. \n\nThe yacht has a Bluetooth surround sound system for your enjoyment. A crew member will assist you in getting you connected. Once connected we will set the stereo at a safe volume. If the volume needs to be adjusted a crew member will assist you.\n\nThe front master bedroom and bathroom are off limits to the guests as we have the owner’s personal belongings in there along with necessary documentation for the coast guard. The door has a sign that reads crew only no entry. Please respect the privacy of the owner. \n\nWe provide you with some ***ice and water*** for hydration. Please make sure you bring with you whatever you wish to eat and drink. Please make sure you bring cups and plates if you feel you will need them. \n\nWe will have a nice cruise from the historic Miami River to the anchorage area. We will be at the anchorage area for approximately 2 hours. You will then have the option to jump in the water, enjoy our floating Lili pad, or rent Jet Skis. If you wish to rent Jet Skis please let the captain know and he can reserve them. \n\nIf you have a balance remaining to be paid, the captain will collect it when your signing the coast guard documents on board the yacht. The balance must be paid in full before the yacht can leave the docks. \n\nThe total amount that you have paid for your charter does not include any ***gratuity*** for the crew. If The Captain and First Mate do a great job ensuring your safety, comfort, & enjoyment. Please show your gratitude by tipping accordingly. Thank you!\n\nWhen you arrive **PLEASE** contact the captain and he will greet you at the main marina entrance door.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "3399 NW South River Dr, Miami Fl 33142", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sfjetskirentals/items/597414/images/1348902/", "pk": 1348902, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/s9jGfokfThuMj5cPlxFQ", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/s9jGfokfThuMj5cPlxFQ", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sfjetskirentals/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sfjetskirentals/items/597414/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/s9jGfokfThuMj5cPlxFQ", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/s9jGfokfThuMj5cPlxFQ", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sfjetskirentals/items/597414/images/1348903/", "pk": 1348903, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Rpu6g5OXQ2iJQqpPtYUQ", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Rpu6g5OXQ2iJQqpPtYUQ", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sfjetskirentals/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sfjetskirentals/items/597414/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Rpu6g5OXQ2iJQqpPtYUQ", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.co